# split_2x2_grain_vs_jbig: 2x2 grain at half density, no repeated 8x8s: nine 2x2s in ten are all one value or split in two halves (stripes, checkers), few have one odd cell, runs about 3 long; JBIG's context model predicts the splits, Tessera writes every split 2x2 as four raw cells
# from record against_jbig: Tessera 34198 bits over JBIG (jbigkit)
